  "description": "One day, Hye-min, the daughter of a fallen noble family, suddenly finds herself with not one, but two handsome male servants. As they enter her life unexpectedly, her quiet days turn into a series of increasingly intimate and complicated nights, entangling the three of them in a delicate web of desire, class differences, and emotional tension.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1515041434), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/tmantkfehfthlemf), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/tw_ds), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000080619), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14564402), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260585)",
